{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04364","headline":"代秦女赠行人 · 刘希夷","name":"代秦女赠行人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾镜晓含春，蛾眉向影嚬。\n开□衣裳破，那堪粉黛新。\n春还洛阳道，爲忆春阶草。\n杨叶未能攀，梅花待君扫。\n今朝喜鹊傍人飞，应是狂夫走马归。\n遥想行歌共游乐，迎前含笑着春衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}